  {"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"The Knight in Black","page":25,"ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":24,"armor":6,"hp":42,"gear":["Lance","Morningstar","Black plate armor","Armored black warhorse"],"text":"A towering knight in black plate on a huge black warhorse, lance lowered at all he meets. Once a dragon knight of Emperor Eledain, his mind was twisted by the necromancer Dakoth, who sent him to the Dead Forest to slay anyone who might find or open the Gates of Power. He barely speaks and never heeds pleas for mercy.","traits":[{"name":"Mounted","text":"Fights as a monster and never leaves his horse; rider and steed are one stat block."},{"name":"Opening Charge","text":"His first monster attack is always #1 (Lance Blow); after that roll randomly."},{"name":"Retreat","text":"Tries to escape once he has lost half his HP. If he survives, he can return later at full HP."},{"name":"Merciless","text":"Leaves defeated foes lying to die."}],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Lance Blow","damage":"3D10","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"shieldOnly":true,"text":"Charges at full gallop and runs one character through with his lance: 3D10 piercing. Can be parried only with a shield, not a weapon."},{"roll":2,"name":"Hissing Threat","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all player characters","range":10,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Halts and calls on the horrors of the Outer Darkness in an alien tongue: every player character within 10 m rolls WIL against fear."},{"roll":3,"name":"Strike From Above","damage":"3D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"Rides at one character and brings his heavy morningstar down from the saddle: 3D8 bludgeoning. Can be parried."},{"roll":4,"name":"Horse Kick","damage":"D10","type":null,"targets":"two within 2 m of each other","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"The warhorse lashes out at two characters within 2 m of each other: D10 damage each, and both are knocked down."},{"roll":5,"name":"Iron Grip","damage":"2D10","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Seizes a character and drags them 2D10 m along the ground, dealing that many points of bludgeoning damage; they end up prone."},{"roll":6,"name":"Escape","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"self","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"text":"He pauses as if scenting something on the wind, wheels his horse and gallops away. The fight ends."}]},
  {"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"The Knight's Consort","page":31,"ferocity":2,"size":"Normal","movement":12,"armor":null,"hp":27,"text":"The vengeful ghost of the barrow knight's wife, buried beside him in the Old Barrow. She manifests the moment anyone touches her bones or grave goods and attacks at once; there's no reasoning with her.","traits":[{"name":"Immunity","text":"Immune to all damage except magic and fire. Defeating her only banishes her for a shift before she returns; only PURGE ends her for good."},{"name":"Implacable","text":"Can't be persuaded or reasoned with."}],"immunities":["All damage except magic and fire"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Ghost Strike","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Lunges at a player character within 10 m, hurling them 2D6 m back for the same bludgeoning damage; they land prone."},{"roll":2,"name":"Touch of Death","damage":"2D10","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":["Scared"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Reaches into the victim's chest and grips the heart: 2D10 damage, armor doesn't help, and they become Scared.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":3,"name":"Ghost Scream","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all player characters within 10 m","range":10,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A soul-chilling scream: every player character within 10 m rolls WIL against fear."},{"roll":4,"name":"Death Stare","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":"bane","conditions":["Scared"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Stares into one character's soul with visions of the dead: they become Scared and suffer a fear attack with a bane on the WIL roll."},{"roll":5,"name":"Ghostly Embrace","damage":"3D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":["Dazed"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Appears in front of someone within 10 m and smothers them: 3D6 bludgeoning and Dazed."},{"roll":6,"name":"Cold Strike","damage":"2D8","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"The chill of death: 2D8 damage, armor doesn't help, and no HP or WP healing until they spend a shift somewhere warm.","ignoresArmor":true}]},
  {"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"The Knight","page":33,"ferocity":2,"size":"Normal","movement":10,"armor":"as worn","armorValue":4,"hp":38,"gear":["Longsword","Chainmail"],"text":"The ancient knight buried in the Old Barrow, his skull split from above and held together by a jeweled gold headband. Now a wight, he rises the instant anyone disturbs his coffin, his body or his treasure.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"Half damage from non-magical weapons; fire deals normal damage."},{"name":"Gear","text":"Enchanted longsword (2D8) and rusted chainmail (armor 4). The sword's enchantment doesn't apply to his monster attacks."}],"resistances":["Non-magical weapons (fire excepted)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Unholy Roar","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 10 m","range":10,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A ghastly scream: everyone within 10 m rolls WIL against fear."},{"roll":2,"name":"Dreadful Gaze","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":"bane","conditions":["Scared"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"One victim meets its eyes: they become Scared and suffer a fear attack with a bane on the WIL roll."},{"roll":3,"name":"Hand of the Dead","damage":"2D4","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"text":"A gesture flings a foe within 10 m 2D4 m away for the same bludgeoning damage; they land prone. Can't be dodged."},{"roll":4,"name":"Sweeping Attack","damage":"weapon","type":null,"targets":"all within 2 m","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"A sudden sweep of its weapon hits every opponent within 2 m for weapon damage. Can be parried.","weapon":true},{"roll":5,"name":"Crippling Cold","damage":"D6","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grabs a victim: D6 damage ignoring armor; on their next turn they must pass Evade (not an action) to act at all, retrying each turn. They also become cold (Rulebook p.54) and can't heal HP or WP until warm.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":6,"name":"Power Attack","damage":"weapon×2","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"A mighty swing rolling double the weapon's damage dice that knocks the victim down. Can be parried.","weapon":true}]},
  {"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Laurinde the Swan Maiden","page":38,"ferocity":1,"size":"Normal","movement":14,"flying":true,"armor":null,"hp":16,"text":"An elf swan maiden whom Stormhand caught and caged in his lair for study. She stays in swan form and silent until sure her rescuers aren't the mage's servants, then demands her freedom and swears to aid them in need — or becomes their sworn enemy if they side with Stormhand.","traits":[{"name":"Shapeshifter","text":"Changes between elf and white swan (either way) as an action. In elf form she's an ordinary NPC; in swan form a monster that can still speak. Clothes and gear change with her unless metal or heavier than half her carrying capacity."},{"name":"Wings","text":"In swan form she flies freely."},{"name":"Ally","text":"Fighting beside the player characters in swan form she doesn't roll on her table — she always uses attack #1 or #2 against their enemies."}],"attacks":[{"damage":"D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"all within 4 m","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"roll":1,"name":"Wingbeat","text":"A gust from her wings: every creature up to human size within 4 m is hurled D8 m, takes the same in bludgeoning and lands prone."},{"damage":"2D8","type":"slashing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"roll":2,"name":"Pecking Attack","text":"Repeated pecks: 2D8 slashing and a fear attack (WIL roll)."},{"damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":["Disheartened"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"roll":3,"name":"Swan Song","text":"A lament for the fallen: everyone within 10 m becomes Disheartened, or takes another condition of their choice if already Disheartened."},{"damage":"2D4","type":"slashing","targets":"all enemies within 10 m","range":10,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"roll":4,"name":"Flock of Swans","text":"Summoned swans mob her foes: every enemy within 10 m takes 2D4 slashing and a fear attack."},{"damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"roll":5,"name":"Pleading Gaze","text":"Begs someone within 10 m to stop fighting: they roll WIL or immediately take a movement and an action (no WP) of the GM's choosing, and lose their turn this round if they haven't acted."},{"damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":10,"fear":"bane","conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"roll":6,"name":"Gift of the Gods","text":"Curses a foe within 10 m with chaotic visions of ancient times: fear attack with a bane on the WIL roll."}]},
  {"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Obald","page":45,"ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":12,"armor":2,"hp":42,"regeneration":"D6","weaknesses":["Sunlight"],"text":"One of the two cave trolls (Obald and Stoka) living apart from the hobgoblins in the Chasm of Caves — ravenous brutes who see every creature as a meal, though a PERSUASION roll plus a gift of valuables can calm them. Hunts alone at night and may ambush travelers in the forest.","traits":[{"name":"Sensitive to Sunlight","text":"Takes D6 damage per round in direct sunlight and can't regenerate; a troll brought to zero HP this way turns to stone. Thick cloud or full-cover clothing protects it."},{"name":"Regeneration","text":"Heals D6 HP each turn in combat, unless it is at zero HP."},{"name":"Treasure Eater","text":"Craves gold coins and small gold items above all food; its belly usually holds D12 gold coins."}],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Rolling Attack","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Curls into a boulder and rolls into one enemy: 2D8 bludgeoning, knocked down."},{"roll":2,"name":"Cave Bats","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"summons":"Vampiric Bats","text":"Stirs up a flock of cave bats that attack its enemies for D3 rounds (use the vampiric bats, Rulebook p.99)."},{"roll":3,"name":"Head to Head","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":["Dazed"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"helmetOnly":true,"text":"Headbutt: 2D6 bludgeoning and Dazed. Only a helmet reduces the damage."},{"roll":4,"name":"Gobble","damage":"2D8","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Bites for 2D8 piercing and holds the victim in its maw: they must roll STR (an action) each round to break free, taking another 2D8 on a failure."},{"roll":5,"name":"Golden Spit","damage":"D10","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":6,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"ranged":true,"text":"Spits a gold coin at someone within 6 m: D10 bludgeoning, a condition of the victim's choice — and they are 1 gold richer."},{"roll":6,"name":"Troll Throw","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Hurls a character 2D8 m in a random direction for the same bludgeoning damage; they land prone."}]},
  {"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Stoka","page":45,"ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":12,"armor":2,"hp":42,"regeneration":"D6","weaknesses":["Sunlight"],"text":"One of the two cave trolls (Obald and Stoka) living apart from the hobgoblins in the Chasm of Caves — ravenous brutes who see every creature as a meal, though a PERSUASION roll plus a gift of valuables can calm them. Sleeps in the troll lair by day and roams out at night.","traits":[{"name":"Sensitive to Sunlight","text":"Takes D6 damage per round in direct sunlight and can't regenerate; a troll brought to zero HP this way turns to stone. Thick cloud or full-cover clothing protects it."},{"name":"Regeneration","text":"Heals D6 HP each turn in combat, unless it is at zero HP."},{"name":"Treasure Eater","text":"Craves gold coins and small gold items above all food; its belly usually holds D12 gold coins."}],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Rolling Attack","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Curls into a boulder and rolls into one enemy: 2D8 bludgeoning, knocked down."},{"roll":2,"name":"Cave Bats","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"summons":"Vampiric Bats","text":"Stirs up a flock of cave bats that attack its enemies for D3 rounds (use the vampiric bats, Rulebook p.99)."},{"roll":3,"name":"Head to Head","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":["Dazed"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"helmetOnly":true,"text":"Headbutt: 2D6 bludgeoning and Dazed. Only a helmet reduces the damage."},{"roll":4,"name":"Gobble","damage":"2D8","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Bites for 2D8 piercing and holds the victim in its maw: they must roll STR (an action) each round to break free, taking another 2D8 on a failure."},{"roll":5,"name":"Golden Spit","damage":"D10","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":6,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"ranged":true,"text":"Spits a gold coin at someone within 6 m: D10 bludgeoning, a condition of the victim's choice — and they are 1 gold richer."},{"roll":6,"name":"Troll Throw","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Hurls a character 2D8 m in a random direction for the same bludgeoning damage; they land prone."}]},
  {"name":"Mogdath","source":"pathofglory","page":59,"category":"Path of Glory","boss":true,"ferocity":2,"size":"Normal","movement":10,"armor":6,"hp":64,"undead":true,"gear":["Aleth-Kheloch","Plate Armor","Keys (#11, #17, #29 chest)"],"text":"A death wight — once a power-hungry knight of Eledain, raised by Dakoth as a fully material knight of living darkness with ember-red eyes, black plate and a black cloak. Unlike common wights it is not tied to one place but goes where its master sends it. Paranoid, quick to rage, cowardly and terrified of fire.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"Non-magical weapons deal half damage; fire, magic and magical weapons deal full damage."},{"name":"Sensitive to Sunlight","text":"Takes D6 damage per stretch in direct sunlight; cloud cover is enough to stop it, but Mogdath prefers to move at night above ground."},{"name":"Immortal","text":"No ordinary means (magic included) can end him: at zero HP he rises again with full HP one shift later — unless his spirit is bound into Tefalas' Dagger."},{"name":"Wary of the Dagger","text":"Knows Tefalas' Dagger on sight; whenever he has a turn left in the round he always parries its attacks, rolling against 15."},{"name":"Aleth-Kheloch","text":"Mastercrafted two-handed sword with a permanent Enchant Weapon (power level 1); damage 2D10. A living wielder is automatically Disheartened in direct sunlight and can't shake it there."},{"name":"Farsight","text":"Regularly spies on far parts of the realm with a form of Farsight, appearing there as a shimmering blue phantom of himself (run through random events)."},{"name":"Keys","text":"Carries the keys to the spiral-stair doors (#10/#11), the council chamber doors (#16/#17) and the locked chest in the Lord Councilor's chamber (#29)."}],"resistances":["Non-magical weapons (fire, magic and magical weapons deal full damage)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Ghost Scream","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 20 m","range":20,"fear":"bane","conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A shriek like a rusty blade through the soul: everyone within 20 m suffers a fear attack with a bane on the WIL roll."},{"roll":2,"name":"Dreadful Gaze","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":10,"fear":"bane","conditions":["Scared"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A victim within 10 m is caught by the burning red eyes: they become Scared and suffer a fear attack with a bane on the WIL roll."},{"roll":3,"name":"Domination","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A spell seizes a victim within 10 m: unless they pass a WIL roll with a bane (not an action) they immediately make a movement and an action of the GM's choosing, and lose their own turn this round if it hasn't come yet."},{"roll":4,"name":"Sweeping Attack","damage":"2D10","type":null,"targets":"all within 2 m","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"Sweeps through the party like a dark cloud: everyone within 2 m takes weapon damage (2D10). Can be parried.","weapon":true},{"roll":5,"name":"Life Drain","damage":"D10","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grabs a victim and draws out their life: they lose D10 HP and the same amount of WP (armor doesn't help), and Mogdath heals that many HP.","ignoresArmor":true,"drain":true,"wpDamage":"D10"},{"roll":6,"name":"Power Attack","damage":"4D10","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"A silent, crushing swing at one character for double weapon damage (4D10); the victim is knocked down. Can be parried.","weapon":true}]},
  {"name":"Daz","source":"pathofglory","page":60,"category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":2,"size":"Normal","movement":12,"armor":null,"hp":32,"undead":true,"text":"A shadow wraith — a featureless, jet-black silhouette, tall, with a cloak that stirs in still air. Mogdath's second-in-command, a necromancer in life who still studies the Outer Darkness for Dakoth. Rules the forge orcs and mine ogres through fear; cold, calculating, fond of frost spells cast from ambush.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"Non-magical weapons and attacks deal half damage; fire deals full damage."},{"name":"Sensitive to Sunlight","text":"Takes D6 damage per stretch in direct sunlight."},{"name":"Shadow Form","text":"Half-material and hovering, but cannot pass through solid matter; moves objects by will alone."},{"name":"Variant","text":"Daz's Frostbite deals 3D6; her Life Drain is D8 HP and D6 WP."}],"resistances":["Non-magical weapons and attacks (fire excepted)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Touch of Death","damage":"2D10","type":null,"targets":"one","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":["Scared"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Plunges a shadow hand into the chest of a victim within 4 m and squeezes the heart: 2D10 damage, armor doesn't help, and the victim becomes Scared.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":2,"name":"Ghost Scream","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 20 m","range":20,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"The silhouette swells and shrieks: everyone within 20 m suffers a fear attack."},{"roll":3,"name":"Crippling Cold","damage":"D8","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Seizes a victim and freezes them stiff: D8 damage ignoring armor; on their next turn they must pass EVADE (not an action) to act at all, retrying each turn. They are also cold (core p.54) and heal no HP or WP until warmed.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":4,"name":"Frostbite","damage":"3D6","type":"cold","targets":"two within 2 m of each other","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A cold spell coats two characters within 10 m (no more than 2 m apart) in ice: 3D6 damage each, armor doesn't help.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":5,"name":"Life Drain","damage":"D8","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grips a victim with both hands and feeds: they lose D8 HP and D6 WP (armor doesn't help) and the wraith heals the HP lost.","ignoresArmor":true,"drain":true,"wpDamage":"D6"},{"roll":6,"name":"Cloud of Darkness","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Dissolves into a black cloud covering everyone within 10 m: total darkness (core p.52) this round and the next that mundane light can't pierce. It can keep making monster attacks in this form."}]},
  {"name":"Gozar","source":"pathofglory","page":60,"category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":2,"size":"Normal","movement":12,"armor":null,"hp":38,"undead":true,"text":"A shadow wraith — a short, stocky black silhouette. Once Daz's pupil, he chose death for magical insight and regretted it too late. Consumed by hatred for the living, he vents it on the orcs unless Mogdath or Daz rein him in, and loves draining victims to husks.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"Non-magical weapons and attacks deal half damage; fire deals full damage."},{"name":"Sensitive to Sunlight","text":"Takes D6 damage per stretch in direct sunlight."},{"name":"Shadow Form","text":"Half-material and hovering, but cannot pass through solid matter; moves objects by will alone."},{"name":"Variant","text":"Gozar's Frostbite deals 2D6; his Life Drain is D10 HP and D10 WP."}],"resistances":["Non-magical weapons and attacks (fire excepted)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Touch of Death","damage":"2D10","type":null,"targets":"one","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":["Scared"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Plunges a shadow hand into the chest of a victim within 4 m and squeezes the heart: 2D10 damage, armor doesn't help, and the victim becomes Scared.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":2,"name":"Ghost Scream","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 20 m","range":20,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"The silhouette swells and shrieks: everyone within 20 m suffers a fear attack."},{"roll":3,"name":"Crippling Cold","damage":"D8","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Seizes a victim and freezes them stiff: D8 damage ignoring armor; on their next turn they must pass EVADE (not an action) to act at all, retrying each turn. They are also cold (core p.54) and heal no HP or WP until warmed.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":4,"name":"Frostbite","damage":"2D6","type":"cold","targets":"two within 2 m of each other","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A cold spell coats two characters within 10 m (no more than 2 m apart) in ice: 2D6 damage each, armor doesn't help.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":5,"name":"Life Drain","damage":"D10","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grips a victim with both hands and feeds: they lose D10 HP and D10 WP (armor doesn't help) and the wraith heals the HP lost.","ignoresArmor":true,"drain":true,"wpDamage":"D10"},{"roll":6,"name":"Cloud of Darkness","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Dissolves into a black cloud covering everyone within 10 m: total darkness (core p.52) this round and the next that mundane light can't pierce. It can keep making monster attacks in this form."}]},
  {"name":"Sharch","source":"pathofglory","page":62,"category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":3,"size":"Large","movement":16,"armor":2,"hp":58,"undead":true,"text":"A nightwarg — an undead, pitch-black two-headed wolf with glowing blue eyes, made by binding a spirit into two fused wolf bodies; one mind, two mouths. Mogdath's solitary, savage and rather dim hound, left to roam the halls and kill whatever lives.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"Non-magical weapons and attacks deal half damage; fire deals full damage."},{"name":"Sensitive to Sunlight","text":"Takes D6 damage per stretch in direct sunlight."}],"resistances":["Non-magical weapons and attacks (fire excepted)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Dreadful Howl","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 20 m","range":20,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"One head throws back and howls: every player character within 20 m rolls WIL against fear."},{"roll":2,"name":"Focused Bite","damage":"2D8","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Both heads bite the same character: two separate hits of 2D8 piercing, each with lethal poison (potency 13).","hits":2,"poison":{"type":"lethal","potency":13}},{"roll":3,"name":"Double Bite","damage":"2D8","type":"piercing","targets":"two within 2 m of each other","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Each head bites a different character (within 2 m of each other): 2D8 piercing and lethal poison (potency 13) for each.","poison":{"type":"lethal","potency":13}},{"roll":4,"name":"Warg Throw","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Snatches a character in its jaws and flings them: 2D6 bludgeoning, landing prone that many metres away."},{"roll":5,"name":"Sudden Pounce","damage":"2D8","type":"slashing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A wild leap and raking claws: 2D8 slashing and the victim is knocked down."},{"roll":6,"name":"Toxic Drool","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 4 m in front","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Spits venomous slaver from both jaws: everyone within 4 m in front of it is exposed to lethal poison (potency 13).","poison":{"type":"lethal","potency":13}}]},
  {"name":"Bone Golem","source":"pathofglory","page":76,"category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":3,"size":"Large","movement":6,"armor":null,"hp":46,"regeneration":"3","undead":true,"text":"A three-metre heap of creaking dwarven bones animated by Mogdath, with four or five arm-like limbs gripping broken swords and axes and three grinning skulls on top. Jerky and clumsy; it kills any living thing in the east parlor (#26) but never leaves the room. A dented white-gold crown (25 gold) sits on one skull.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"Piercing weapons deal half damage."},{"name":"Regeneration","text":"Heals 3 HP at the start of every round."},{"name":"Bound to the Room","text":"Wakes when a living creature comes within 2 m of the bone pile; never leaves the parlor."}],"resistances":["Piercing"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Double Strike","damage":"2D8","type":"slashing","targets":"two within 2 m of each other","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Strikes two opponents standing within 2 m of each other: 2D8 slashing each."},{"roll":2,"name":"Bone Lance","damage":"3D6","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":6,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Shapes a spear of bone that shoots out at a foe within 6 m: 3D6 piercing."},{"roll":3,"name":"Flurry of Bones","damage":"2D6","type":"slashing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A storm of swinging bone limbs: three hits of 2D6 slashing in a row on one opponent, who is then knocked down.","hits":3},{"roll":4,"name":"Voice from the Grave","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 10 m","range":10,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"All three skulls screech like bone under a saw: every opponent within 10 m suffers a fear attack."},{"roll":5,"name":"Death's Embrace","damage":"D6","type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Engulfs a player character: on their turn they can only try to break free (STR roll, an action), and they take D6 damage, ignoring armor, each time the golem has a turn.","ignoresArmor":true},{"roll":6,"name":"Bone Storm","damage":"2D6","type":"slashing","targets":"all within 4 m","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Whirls into a maelstrom of bone: every opponent within 4 m takes 2D6 slashing."}]},
  {"name":"The Brandy Dragon","source":"pathofglory","page":78,"category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":8,"armor":3,"hp":36,"text":"A horse-sized dragon with black-green scales and stubby flightless wings that crept down a brewery flue as a hatchling and grew too big to leave. Lazy, mildly clever and good-natured; speaks dragon tongue and some ancient Dwarvish (LANGUAGES to talk). Loves dwarves, fire and brandy; hates orcs and undead.","traits":[{"name":"Wary Host","text":"Attacks orcs and undead on sight. Others may pass with PERSUASION or BLUFFING — a boon for anyone carrying a torch, since it adores fire."},{"name":"Ally","text":"Light its fireplaces and it stays awake and content for a shift, keeping Mogdath's forces out so the heroes can take a shift rest (once only)."}],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Claw Attack","damage":"2D8","type":"slashing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A lightning-fast swipe at one character: 2D8 slashing."},{"roll":2,"name":"Double Slash","damage":"2D6","type":"slashing","targets":"two","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Rakes its claws across two opponents: 2D6 slashing each."},{"roll":3,"name":"Tail Strike","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"all behind it","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Swings its spiked tail: everyone behind the dragon takes 2D6 bludgeoning and is knocked down."},{"roll":4,"name":"Jaw Grip","damage":"2D8","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Clamps a foe in its jaws and shakes them: 2D8 piercing, they drop a weapon in hand (GM's pick) and land prone."},{"roll":5,"name":"Ramming Lunge","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Barrels into a foe, hurling them 2D6 m back (or into the nearest wall) for the same bludgeoning damage; they land prone."},{"roll":6,"name":"Fire Breath","damage":"2D10","type":"fire","targets":"all in a 4 m cone","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Breathes a 4 m cone of flame (as wide at each point as its distance from the mouth): everyone caught takes 2D10, armor doesn't help.","ignoresArmor":true}]},
  {"name":"Stone Guardian","source":"pathofglory","page":84,"category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":4,"armor":6,"hp":60,"text":"A three-metre statue of a rough, rock-grown dwarf-like figure — a variant of the earth elemental gnome, bound by stone magic to guard the treasure trove (#45). It questions intruders first (in ancient Dwarvish, then the common tongue) but attacks anyone who takes anything. Very slow; chases thieves but never leaves the City.","traits":[{"name":"Guardian","text":"Demands an explanation before fighting; immediately attacks anyone removing an item from the podium."},{"name":"Last Resort","text":"At 30 HP or less it stops fighting and smashes one corner pillar per turn; that starts a chain reaction that brings the ceiling down on the southern City three rounds later (see #45)."}],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Crush","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Hurls its bulk onto a character: 2D8 bludgeoning and knocked down."},{"roll":2,"name":"Whirling Fists","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"all within 2 m","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Swings both fists around: every opponent within 2 m takes 2D6 bludgeoning."},{"roll":3,"name":"Throw","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grabs a foe and flings them 2D6 m for the same bludgeoning damage; they land prone."},{"roll":4,"name":"Two in One Hit","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"two","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grabs one opponent and smashes them into a companion: both take 2D6 bludgeoning and are knocked down."},{"roll":5,"name":"Rock Storm","damage":"3D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":"bane","text":"Tries to pound a victim flat with its fists: 3D6 bludgeoning, and dodging it is rolled with a bane."},{"roll":6,"name":"Recovery","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"text":"Kneels and half-merges with the floor, drawing strength from the stone: it heals D10 HP.","heal":"D10"}]},
  {"id":"azarizag","name":"Azarizag","page":111,"source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":18,"armor":null,"hp":64,"text":"A fire demon bound to the bitter old priest Gultrub; the two are united only by their loathing of Sathmog. She appears in smoke whenever Gultrub calls, or when anyone touches the warded trapdoor to his ritual cellar. Same profile as the Bestiary fire demon.","traits":[{"name":"Scorching Body","text":"Touching her deals D6 damage that armor doesn't stop; the heat gives every opponent a bane on melee attacks against her."},{"name":"Immunity","text":"Fire damage has no effect on her."},{"name":"Vulnerability","text":"Water-based magic deals double damage. A thrown bucket of water deals D10, a tankard of ale or jug of wine D8, spitting 1 point; roll Brawling to hit with these."}],"immunities":["fire"],"weaknesses":["water (double damage from water magic; bucket D10, ale/wine D8, spit 1 — Brawling to hit)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Sweeping Staff","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"all within 2 m","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"extraDamage":{"dice":"D6","ignoresArmor":true},"text":"Her red-hot iron staff sweeps every foe within 2 m: 2D6 bludgeoning plus D6 heat damage that ignores armor; all are knocked down."},{"roll":2,"name":"Imps","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":["Angry"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A cloud of burning, jeering imps whirls out: everyone within 10 m becomes Angry."},{"roll":3,"name":"Flaming Flail","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":["Dazed"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"extraDamage":{"dice":"D8","type":"fire","ignoresArmor":true},"text":"A flail strike on one foe: 2D8 bludgeoning plus D8 fire that ignores armor; the victim is Dazed."},{"roll":4,"name":"Fire Whirl","damage":"2D8","type":"fire","targets":"all within 4 m","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"ignoresArmor":true,"text":"She spins the flail into a column of fire: everyone within 4 m takes 2D8 fire (armor doesn't help) and is knocked down."},{"roll":5,"name":"Crushing Kick","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"A sudden kick hurls a foe 2D6 m away for the same amount of bludgeoning damage; they land prone."},{"roll":6,"name":"Fire Breath","damage":"2D10","type":"fire","targets":"cone","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"ignoresArmor":true,"text":"A 10 m cone of flame (as wide as its distance from her): all caught take 2D10 fire, armor doesn't help."}],"variantOf":"Fire Demon"},
  {"id":"pog-iskolde","source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Iskolde","page":133,"ferocity":2,"size":"Normal","movement":6,"armor":null,"hp":48,"text":"The embalmed elven shieldmaiden who held the line against Sathmog's demons, wrapped tight in her tomb on Is-Hel. She rises in fury the moment anyone lays a hand on her shield.","traits":[{"name":"Resistance","text":"No internal organs: half damage from piercing weapons."},{"name":"Flammable","text":"Tinder-dry: double damage from fire."},{"name":"The Battle Shield Iskolde","text":"Her mastercrafted large shield (durability 18) holds a variant MAGIC SHIELD. Whoever bears it can parry an incoming spell with any weapon skill; on success the spell is fully blocked at no WP cost and the bearer gains WP equal to its power level. Iskolde spends actions on this against spells when she can. Heroes who take it must first decipher its inscriptions (Rulebook p.59)."}],"resistances":["piercing"],"weaknesses":["fire (double damage)"],"gear":["The Battle Shield Iskolde (mastercrafted large shield)"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Curse","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all player characters within 10 m","range":10,"fear":true,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Hisses a dread curse: every player character within 10 m must roll WIL against fear."},{"roll":2,"name":"Shield Bash","damage":"3D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Smashes a player character with her shield: 3D6 bludgeoning, knocked down."},{"roll":3,"name":"Shield Throw","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"player character with the lowest STR within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Flings her shield at the lowest-STR player character within 10 m for 2D8 bludgeoning, then walks over to retrieve it."},{"roll":4,"name":"Shield Slam","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"all player characters within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":["Dazed"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"text":"Drives her shield into the floor: every player character within 10 m is dazed and must roll EVADE (no action) or lose their turn this round if not yet taken. Can't be dodged.","losesTurn":"EVADE"},{"roll":5,"name":"Deadly Throw","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Hurls a player character 2D6 m; they land prone and take the same in bludgeoning damage."},{"roll":6,"name":"Strangulation","damage":"D10","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Seizes a throat: D10 bludgeoning (armor doesn't help) and D10 more on each of her turns. The victim can't move or take movement actions except to break free (STR with a bane; others may help). She makes no other monster attacks until the victim breaks free or drops to zero HP.","ignoresArmor":true,"ongoing":"D10","grapple":{"breakFree":"STR","bane":true,"help":true}}]},
  {"id":"pog-demonic-seed-pods","source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Demonic Seed Pods","page":139,"ferocity":2,"size":"Swarm","movement":24,"armor":null,"hp":38,"text":"A whirling cloud of winged, thorned seeds shed by the Ur-Fang of Fang-Forren, buzzing down on travelers like a hunting swarm.","traits":[{"name":"Swarm","text":"Treated as one monster. Physical damage other than fire is halved (rounded up)."}],"resistances":["All physical damage except fire"],"attackDie":"D6","attackRolls":[[1,2],[3,4],[5,6]],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Swirling Attack","damage":"D10","type":"piercing","targets":"all player characters within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Thorny pods spin around everyone within 10 m: D10 piercing each; anyone whose armor is penetrated is also injected with paralyzing poison (potency 12).","rolls":[1,2],"poison":{"type":"paralyzing","potency":12,"ifPenetrates":true}},{"roll":3,"name":"Focused Attack","damage":"2D8","type":"piercing","targets":"player character with the highest CON","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"The whole swarm converges on the highest-CON player character: 2D8 piercing, plus paralyzing poison (potency 12) if it gets through armor.","rolls":[3,4],"poison":{"type":"paralyzing","potency":12,"ifPenetrates":true}},{"roll":5,"name":"Demonic Control","damage":"D3","type":null,"targets":"player character with the lowest WIL","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"The pods smother the lowest-WIL player character: D3 damage (armor doesn't help) and a WIL roll. On failure the victim must at once move to the nearest player character and make a melee attack, and loses their turn this round (or next round if it has passed).","rolls":[5,6],"ignoresArmor":true}]},
  {"id":"pog-ur-fang","source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Ur-Fang","page":140,"ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":8,"armor":6,"hp":64,"text":"Demonic walking trees, the true masters of Fang-Forren. They string captives up in thorny vines and keep them alive until more of their kind arrive to drink their blood.","traits":[{"name":"Flammable","text":"Double damage from fire-based attacks; it does everything it can to stop foes using fire."},{"name":"Resistance","text":"Half damage from piercing and bludgeoning weapons, after armor."},{"name":"Demonic","text":"Counts as a demon for all rules purposes."}],"resistances":["piercing","bludgeoning"],"weaknesses":["Fire (double damage)"],"demon":true,"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Seed Pods","damage":"D10","type":"piercing","targets":"all opponents within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Shakes loose a shower of seed pods over every foe within 10 m: D10 piercing each, plus paralyzing poison (potency 12) for anyone whose armor is penetrated.","poison":{"type":"paralyzing","potency":12,"ifPenetrates":true}},{"roll":2,"name":"Spear Thrust","damage":"2D10","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"Grows a branch into a spear and drives it at a foe: 2D10 piercing. Can be parried."},{"roll":3,"name":"Crushing Blow","damage":"2D10","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Brings its thickest bough down on a foe's head: 2D10 bludgeoning, knocked down."},{"roll":4,"name":"Up, Up and Away","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Grabs a foe and throws them 2D8 m; they take the same in bludgeoning damage and land prone."},{"roll":5,"name":"Hang Them High","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Loops a branch round a foe's neck: 2D6 bludgeoning and 2D6 more on each of the victim's turns. They can't move or take movement actions except to break free (an action, STR with a bane; others may help). Ur-Fang can keep acting meanwhile.","ongoing":"2D6","grapple":{"breakFree":"STR","bane":true,"help":true,"action":true}},{"roll":6,"name":"Demonic Control","damage":"D6","type":null,"targets":"player character with the lowest WIL within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Stabs its roots into the lowest-WIL player character within 10 m: D6 damage (armor doesn't help), then WIL (with a bane); if that fails, the victim must at once move to the nearest player character and make a melee attack, and loses their turn this round (or next if it has passed).","ignoresArmor":true}]},
  {"id":"pog-morgasa","source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Morgasa","page":146,"ferocity":2,"size":"Large","movement":12,"armor":null,"hp":44,"regeneration":"D6","text":"Troll witch left by Sathmog to guard the Demon Tower and the Heart of Darkness. She spies through ravens and often wears the shape of a great blue-sheened raven herself; she loathes the undead.","traits":[{"name":"Raven Form","text":"Movement 24 and free flight while shaped as a raven."},{"name":"Regeneration","text":"Heals D6 HP each turn in combat unless already at zero HP."},{"name":"Stench","text":"Anyone coming within 10 m rolls CON (not an action) or becomes Dazed."},{"name":"Insensitive to Sunlight","text":"Unlike other trolls, sunlight does not harm her."}],"gear":["Huge club"],"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Hex","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"player character with the lowest WIL within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"text":"Curses the lowest-WIL player character within 10 m, who rolls WIL to resist; if cursed they lose D8 WP and suffer a bane on all rolls for a stretch. Can't be dodged.","curse":true},{"roll":2,"name":"Rotten Breath","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"one","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":["Sickly"],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Breathes on a foe within 4 m: they become Sickly and must roll CON (with a bane) or lose their turn this round if not yet taken.","losesTurn":"CON"},{"roll":3,"name":"A Murder of Ravens","damage":"D8","type":"piercing","targets":"all player characters within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Her raven flock descends on every player character within 10 m: D8 piercing each."},{"roll":4,"name":"Stomping Attack","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"all opponents within 2 m","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Stamps wildly at every foe within 2 m: 2D6 bludgeoning and knocked down."},{"roll":5,"name":"Beak and Talons","damage":"3D8","type":"piercing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Turns raven and tears into a player character: 3D8 piercing, knocked down; then she returns to troll shape."},{"roll":6,"name":"Bludgeoning Club","damage":"4D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":["Dazed"],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"Her heaviest club blow: 4D6 bludgeoning and the victim is Dazed. Can be parried."}]},
  {"id":"pog-karlak-ash-ark-afar","source":"pathofglory","category":"Path of Glory","name":"Karlak Sol-Tar & Ash-Ark-Afar","page":150,"ferocity":3,"size":"Huge","movement":24,"flying":true,"armor":6,"hp":84,"text":"A dragon knight of Immer-Drak beyond the Sea of Dreams, sworn to destroy the Heart of Darkness, riding the dragon Ash-Ark-Afar. He can be talked round — he can't actually burn the heart.","traits":[{"name":"Rider and Mount","text":"One monster with two HP pools. Ash-Ark-Afar: HP 84, armor 6, Movement 24. Karlak Sol-Tar: HP 48, armor 8, WP 24, Movement 10; while mounted he can only be hit by ranged attacks or long melee weapons. Players choose which to attack."},{"name":"Wings","text":"The dragon flies freely."},{"name":"Heroic Abilities (rider)","text":"Defensive, Robust ×15."},{"name":"If One Falls","text":"If the dragon dies, Karlak fights on alone as a regular NPC to the death. If Karlak falls, the dragon stops fighting, picks him up and flies home east."}],"gear":["Longsword (mastercrafted)","Plate armor","Great helm","Cloak","Eight rations of food"],"rider":{"name":"Karlak Sol-Tar","hp":48,"armor":8,"wp":24,"movement":10,"abilities":["Defensive","Robust ×15"]},"mount":{"name":"Ash-Ark-Afar","hp":84,"armor":6,"movement":24,"flying":true},"attacks":[{"roll":1,"name":"Dragon Roar","damage":null,"type":null,"targets":"everyone within 20 m","range":20,"fear":"bane","conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":false,"text":"Ash-Ark-Afar roars: everyone within 20 m faces a fear attack, rolling WIL with a bane."},{"roll":2,"name":"Sword Swing","damage":"2D8+D6","type":"slashing","targets":"two opponents within 4 m of each other","range":4,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"Karlak sweeps his blade across two foes within 4 m of each other: 2D8+D6 slashing each. Can be parried."},{"roll":3,"name":"Dragon Wind","damage":"2D6","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"everyone within 10 m","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Wingbeats raise a gale over everyone within 10 m: human-sized or smaller creatures and loose objects fly 2D6 m, take that much bludgeoning damage and land prone. Someone about to go over the roof edge gets an EVADE roll (no action) to catch themselves; failing that, an ACROBATICS roll to grab hold, then another ACROBATICS roll to climb back up."},{"roll":4,"name":"Tail Strike","damage":"2D8","type":"bludgeoning","targets":"everyone within 6 m","range":6,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":true,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Ash-Ark-Afar lashes its spiked tail: everyone within 6 m takes 2D8 bludgeoning and is knocked down."},{"roll":5,"name":"Mighty Blow","damage":"4D8+D6","type":"slashing","targets":"one","range":2,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":true,"dodge":true,"text":"Karlak puts everything into one sword stroke at a player character: 4D8+D6 slashing. Can be parried."},{"roll":6,"name":"Fire Breath","damage":"3D10","type":"fire","targets":"everyone in a 10 m cone","range":10,"fear":false,"conditions":[],"prone":false,"parry":false,"dodge":true,"text":"Ash-Ark-Afar exhales fire in a 10 m cone (as wide at each point as its distance from the mouth): 3D10 fire damage to everyone in it, armor doesn't help.","ignoresArmor":true}]}
